flavour|auxiliary_screen	0	Hegemony auxiliary fleets are made of whatever the Navy can requisition, and the battle line is expected to shelter them. A cycle of convoy duty out of Jangala teaches the crew to keep the ship between the enemy and the smaller hulls. The auxiliaries are grateful, in the manner of people who have been told to be.
flavourAutomated|auxiliary_screen	0	Hegemony auxiliary fleets are made of whatever the Navy can requisition, and the battle line is expected to shelter them. The ship's core logs a cycle of convoy duty out of Jangala and learns to keep its hull between the enemy and the smaller ships. The auxiliaries are grateful, in the manner of people who have been told to be.
type|auxiliary_screen|null|0	0	Allied ships of a smaller hull size within 800 su take <good>10%</good> less damage. Only the strongest buff of this effect applies at any one time.
