flavour|beautiful_nightmare	0	Stargazers fight hardest when they are dying, and the Stardust Core recovered from one, the remains of what was once a person, shows the crew how to strip the ship's safeties the moment its hull starts to fail.
flavourAutomated|beautiful_nightmare	0	Stargazers fight hardest when they are dying. The Stardust Core recovered from one, the remains of what was once a person, holds the routine that strips a ship's safeties the moment its hull starts to fail. The ship's core runs it without hesitation.
type|beautiful_nightmare|null|0	0	When its hull drops below 25% during a battle, the ship enters Terminal Descent until its hull is back above 40%. During Terminal Descent, <good>25%</good> reduced hull damage taken, but peak performance time stops and venting is blocked.
