flavour|blood_in_the_water	0	A good pirate doesn't wait for their prey to recover.
type|blood_in_the_water|null|0	0	Whenever an enemy ship is destroyed within 1000 su, this ship gains a Pirate Frenzy stack for 10 seconds. Ships can hold up to 5 Pirate Frenzy stacks.\n5% increased weapon rate of fire for each Pirate Frenzy stack.\n5% reduced weapon flux cost for each Pirate Frenzy stack.
