flavour|doctrine_escrowed_emitters	0	Tri-Tachyon sells its shield emitters with firmware locked behind subscription keys. A crew that cracks the lock on a salvaged emitter finds the full rated performance sitting under it, and the subscription reminders keep arriving regardless.
