flavour|freebooters_charge	0	Pirate captains who joined the crew drill the habits that make freebooters so dangerous up close: charge in, fire everything and count the casualties later. They rarely do the counting.
flavourAutomated|freebooters_charge	0	The ship's core logs every fight it sees freebooters win up close: charge in, fire everything and count the casualties later. It copies the first two steps exactly. It always does the counting.
