flavour|furor_machinae	0	Combat recordings pulled from a Stargazer's data core show its fire rate climbing with every hit, as if something inside it were growing angrier. The crew rewires this ship's fire control to chase the same rhythm, and tries not to wonder what it is chasing.
flavourAutomated|furor_machinae	0	Combat recordings pulled from a Stargazer's data core show its fire rate climbing with every hit, as if something inside it were growing angrier. The ship's core matches the rhythm exactly. It does not wonder what it is matching.
type|furor_machinae|null|0	0	Damage dealt to enemy ships builds fury, granting up to <good>15%</good> increased weapon rate of fire, full after 2000/4000/8000/20000 damage. Shield hits count at half, EMP at a quarter. Fury fades by 1% per second.
