flavour|ground_support	0	Raids flown alongside pirate crews teach the crew to turn spare berths and cargo lifts into a drop platform for the marines, and to keep a few guns pointed at the ground while they work.
flavourAutomated|ground_support	0	The ship's core logs every pirate raid it flies beside, down to where the guns point while the marines are on the ground. The refit crew turns its cargo lifts into a drop platform, and the core keeps the guns where the logs say.
type|ground_support|null|0	0	Your fleet gains effective planetary raid strength equal to <good>25%</good> of this ship's maximum crew capacity, up to the total number of marines in the fleet.
