flavour|hardlight_marking	0	Nightcross Restricted Hardlight Rifles, looted from a hidden NCA research outpost, keep count of every hit they land on a target, and the crew learns to port that counter into this carrier's wing datalink.
flavourAutomated|hardlight_marking	0	Nightcross Restricted Hardlight Rifles, looted from a hidden NCA research outpost, keep count of every hit they land on a target. The ship's core reads the counter's firmware and ports it into its own wing datalink.
