flavour|hullbreacher_rounds	0	Former Hegemony Navy gunners in the crew remember the breacher loads the Navy keeps for boarding actions, shells hardened to punch through plating instead of bursting on it. The crew sees no reason to save them for boarding.
flavourAutomated|hullbreacher_rounds	0	The Hegemony Navy keeps breacher loads for boarding actions, shells hardened to punch through plating instead of bursting on it. The ship's core finds their specifications in a seized Navy ordnance manifest and loads them for every fight. It has no boarding actions to save them for.
type|hullbreacher_rounds|null|0	0	Ballistic projectile hits on an enemy ship's armor or hull have a <good>20%</good> chance to pierce. A pierced shot cannot pierce again.
