flavour|hybrid_p_space_shrouding	0	Leaked papers from Tri-Tachyon's Hybrid Physics Division (on phase work the corporation swears it abandoned under the Treaty of Thule) show the crew how to bleed this ship's sensor emissions into the masking field phase ships throw over a fleet. Tri-Tachyon maintains the papers are forgeries.
flavourAutomated|hybrid_p_space_shrouding	0	Leaked papers from Tri-Tachyon's Hybrid Physics Division (on phase work the corporation swears it abandoned under the Treaty of Thule) describe how to bleed a ship's sensor emissions into the masking field phase ships throw over a fleet. The ship's core parses them in full, footnotes included. Tri-Tachyon maintains the papers are forgeries.
type|hybrid_p_space_shrouding|null|0	0	50% of this ship's sensor strength counts toward the fleet-wide reduction in detected-at range that phase ships provide. Only applies while your fleet's transponder is off.
