flavour|ion_bolter_rounds	0	The NCA Vendor sells Ion Bolters to any well-funded mercenary, and taking one apart shows the crew how to overdrive this ship's energy shots the same way. The terms of sale forbid exactly this, in very small print.
flavourAutomated|ion_bolter_rounds	0	The NCA Vendor sells Ion Bolters to any well-funded mercenary, and taking one apart shows the refit crew how to overdrive this ship's energy shots the same way. The terms of sale forbid exactly this, in very small print.
