flavour|knights_charge	0	The Knights of Ludd hold that a righteous ship meets its enemy at full burn, and drilling alongside them at Ceyx teaches the crew to trim the engines and controls for the charge.
flavourAutomated|knights_charge	0	The Knights of Ludd hold that a righteous ship meets its enemy at full burn. The ship's core logs their charges at Ceyx and trims its engines and controls to match. The Knights would not call the result righteous.
