flavour|league_picket_targeting	0	Studying the sensor pickets the League posts along its Hegemony border shows the crew how to slave energy weapon targeting to the ship's own sensors. The pickets are the one League institution every member world agrees to fund.
flavourAutomated|league_picket_targeting	0	The ship's core logs the sweeps of the sensor pickets the League posts along its Hegemony border and slaves its energy weapon targeting to its own sensors on the same pattern. The pickets are the one League institution every member world agrees to fund.
type|league_picket_targeting|null|0	0	<good>+1</good> to energy weapon range for every point of this ship's sensor strength.
