flavour|league_reload_drill	0	League fleets drawn from a dozen squabbling polities still share one reload drill, so that any ship can rearm any other. It is the one thing the member worlds have never argued over, and serving under a League commission drills it into the crew.
flavourAutomated|league_reload_drill	0	League fleets drawn from a dozen squabbling polities still share one reload drill, so that any ship can rearm any other. The ship's core records it from the League ships it serves beside and runs it the same way every time, which no League crew has ever managed.
