flavour|lions_gaze	0	Diktat propaganda insists that the Lion's gaze falls on every citizen at once, and the engineer-technicians of the Lion's Guard took the slogan literally. Studying the Executors they refit teaches the crew to split this ship's beams across the target and the enemy ships around it.
flavourAutomated|lions_gaze	0	Diktat propaganda insists that the Lion's gaze falls on every citizen at once, and the engineer-technicians of the Lion's Guard took the slogan literally. The ship's core records how a Lion's Guard Executor divides its beams across a target and the ships around it, and splits its own the same way. It does not record the slogan.
type|lions_gaze|null|0	0	Beam weapon hits split their damage evenly across the target and up to 1 additional nearby enemy ship. Strikecraft are never chosen. The target acquisition range is half the beam weapon's range.
type|lions_gaze|FRIGATE|0	0	Beam weapon hits split their damage evenly across the target and up to 1 additional nearby enemy ship. Strikecraft are never chosen. The target acquisition range is half the beam weapon's range.
