flavour|martyrs_payload	0	Picking through the wrecks of Luddic Path carriers showed the crew how the Path tears the engine governors out of its bombers and arms their warheads the moment they leave the deck. The faithful accept that some payloads go off before they ever reach the enemy.
flavourAutomated|martyrs_payload	0	Flight recorders from wrecked Luddic Path carriers show how the Path tears the engine governors out of its bombers and arms their warheads the moment they leave the deck. The ship's core applies the same settings to its own bombers, and logs the ones that go off early without comment.
