flavour|neural_interface	0	A direct neural link between this ship and the flagship. Captains who use one describe it as standing on two bridges at once, and are sometimes vague afterwards about which one they were on.
flavourAutomated|neural_interface	0	A direct neural link between this ship and the flagship. Captains who link to an automated hull describe a second bridge with nobody else on it, and are not always certain of that afterwards.
type|neural_interface|null|0	0	Transferring to either linked ship resets its ship system cooldown and adds a charge.
