flavour|nskr_criticalArmor	0	A prototype modspec from Kesteven R&D shows the crew how to reinforce a light hull's critical structural points, where thin plating fails first.
flavourAutomated|nskr_criticalArmor	0	A prototype modspec from Kesteven R&D shows the refit crew how to reinforce a light hull's critical structural points, where thin plating fails first.
type|nskr_criticalArmor|null|0	0	Up to <good>+400/700/900/1200</good> to armor. The bonus is highest on hulls with the least base armor and falls to <good>+150/300/400/500</good> at <hl>400/700/900/1200</hl> base armor. Can't be allocated on phase ships or on hulls with more base armor than that.
