flavour|nskr_volatile	0	A prototype flux injector from Kesteven R&D lets the crew trade staying power for tempo. The modspec describes the side effects as manageable.
flavourAutomated|nskr_volatile	0	A prototype flux injector from Kesteven R&D lets the refit crew trade staying power for tempo. The modspec describes the side effects as manageable. With nobody aboard, nobody has to manage them.
type|nskr_volatile|null|0	0	Weapon rate of fire changes with flux, from <good>40%</good> increased at no flux to <bad>40%</bad> reduced at full flux, with no change at half flux. Venting or being overloaded counts as full flux.
