flavour|perseverance_through_faith	0	Luddic faithful among the crew hold that a scarred ship, like a penitent, finds its strength in hardship. They keep its battered guns fighting with patient hands, and refuse every offer to have them properly repaired.
flavourAutomated|perseverance_through_faith	0	Luddic faithful hold that a scarred ship, like a penitent, finds its strength in hardship. The ship's core holds no faith, only damage logs showing the battered guns of Luddic ships firing long past the point they should have failed. It keeps its own guns fighting the same way.
