flavour|phase_entangled_wings	0	Tri-Tachyon's phase labs learned to lock the coils of a strike craft wing into one shared state, so a hit on one craft bleeds through p-space into the whole wing. A defector from those labs, smuggled out at no small cost, walks the crew through retuning this carrier's strike craft coils to the same entangled frequency.
flavourAutomated|phase_entangled_wings	0	Tri-Tachyon's phase labs learned to lock the coils of a strike craft wing into one shared state, so a hit on one craft bleeds through p-space into the whole wing. A defector from those labs, smuggled out at no small cost, walks the refit crew through retuning this carrier's strike craft coils to the same entangled frequency.
