flavour|repair_coordinator	0	The wreck of an NCA Occator still holds the delta-level coordinator that once steered its repair drones between damaged hulls. The crew wires it into this ship's damage-control network, teaching it to send work teams and drones across to patch the armor of nearby allies in the middle of a battle.
flavourAutomated|repair_coordinator	0	The wreck of an NCA Occator still holds the delta-level coordinator that once steered its repair drones between damaged hulls. Wired into this ship's damage-control network, it sends the ship's drones across to patch the armor of nearby allies in the middle of a battle.
type|repair_coordinator|null|0	0	Repairs the armor of the closest damaged allied ship within 1000 su by <good>1%</good> of its total armor per second. Each ship with this effect restores at most 10% of any one ally's armor per battle, and each ally regains at most 30% in total from all of them. Pauses while overloaded or venting.
