flavour|sindrian_shielding	0	Sindria's day side is scoured by radiation, and array workers who fled the Askonia Crisis to sign on with this crew know how to harden an emitter against it. They learned the hard way, as most Sindrians learn most things.
flavourAutomated|sindrian_shielding	0	Sindria's day side is scoured by radiation, and the emitters on its orbital arrays are hardened against it. The refit crew copies the shielding pattern from a derelict Askonian array onto this ship's emitters. Whoever designed it learned the hard way, as most Sindrians learn most things.
type|sindrian_shielding|null|0	1	<bad>10%</bad> less damage taken by shields.
