flavour|tania_solaris_overdrive	0	The Aracari is a prime example of antique thermo-dynamic engineering, with its Solaris Phalanx system allowing weapons to fire without directly drawing from the main flux grid. By analyzing old Farige databanks, your crew is now able to mimic its functionality in a small scale basis.
type|tania_solaris_overdrive|null|0	0	Weapons cost no flux to fire for <good>4</good> seconds after this ship's system activates, at most once every 60 seconds.
type|tania_solaris_overdrive|null|1	0	<good>50%</good> increased weapon projectile speed for those seconds.
