flavour|tania_thermo_accelerator	0	The legendary NTS Endurance, an Aetos Class Destroyer, managed to nail down multiple enemy frigates at once, protecting its fleet from terrific flankers, thanks to its Thermo-Accelerator system. By understanding the tactics employed by its captain and the ship's overengineered ammo feeders, your crew is now able to draw power from hardpoint weapon mounts so its turret weapons fire cooler in a similar fashion.
