flavour|tripad_backdoor	0	Every TriPad in the Sector ships with backdoors Tri-Tachyon officially denies, and a crew that learns them can talk a nav buoy or comm relay into changing sides mid-battle. Company support declines to comment, but will gladly sell an upgrade.
