flavour|waste_not	0	Freebooters who signed on at a pirate base taught the crew to strip every wreck to the frame and to patch the ship back to fighting trim from whatever a battle leaves behind. Nothing is wasted, least of all the dead.
flavourAutomated|waste_not	0	The ship's core logs how freebooters strip every wreck to the frame and patch their ships back to fighting trim from whatever a battle leaves behind. Its repair drones do the same. Nothing is wasted, least of all the dead.
